{"title": "Delhi High Court Orders Removal of Defamatory Social Media Posts Against BJP MP", "summary": "The Delhi High Court has directed the removal of five social media posts deemed defamatory against BJP MP Raghav Chadha. The court ruled that while some content was defamatory, it did not involve a violation of personality rights. This decision highlights the thin line between defamation and legitimate criticism in online discourse.", "summary_points": ["The Delhi High Court has ordered the removal of five social media posts against BJP MP Raghav Chadha.", "The court ruled that some content was defamatory, but did not involve a violation of personality rights.", "This decision highlights the thin line between defamation and legitimate criticism in online discourse.", "The court emphasized the distinction between defamation and legitimate criticism, suggesting that freedom of speech should not be used to run paid character assassination campaigns.", "The ruling has implications for online discourse and the limits of free speech in India."], "title_hi": "दिल्ली उच्च न्यायालय ने बीजेपी सांसद रघव चड्ढा के खिलाफ विरोधाभासी सोशल मीडिया पोस्टों को हटाने का आदेश दिया", "summary_hi": "दिल्ली उच्च न्यायालय ने बीजेपी सांसद रघव चड्ढा के खिलाफ विरोधाभासी सोशल मीडिया पोस्टों को हटाने का आदेश दिया। अदालत ने कहा कि कुछ सामग्री व्यंगात्मक थी, लेकिन यह व्यक्तिगत अधिकारों का उल्लंघन नहीं था। इस फैसले में ऑनलाइन चर्चा में विरोधाभास और वैध आलोचना और व्यंग के बीच सीमा की पहचान करने का महत्व है।", "summary_points_hi": ["दिल्ली उच्च न्यायालय ने बीजेपी सांसद रघव चड्ढा के खिलाफ विरोधाभासी सोशल मीडिया पोस्टों को हटाने का आदेश दिया।", "अदालत ने कहा कि कुछ सामग्री व्यंगात्मक थी, लेकिन यह व्यक्तिगत अधिकारों का उल्लंघन नहीं था।", "इस फैसले में ऑनलाइन चर्चा में विरोधाभास और वैध आलोचना और व्यंग के बीच सीमा की पहचान करने का महत्व है।", "अदालत ने सुझाव दिया कि स्वतंत्र भाषण का उपयोग व्यक्तिगत हमलों के लिए नहीं किया जाना चाहिए।", "इस फैसले में ऑनलाइन चर्चा पर प्रभाव और स्वतंत्र भाषण की सीमाओं को संबोधित करने का महत्व है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the importance of protecting personality rights and distinguishing between defamation and legitimate criticism. They also highlight the need for greater regulation of online content to prevent character assassination campaigns.", "center": "Centrist coverage frames the story as a nuanced exploration of the thin line between defamation and legitimate criticism, with an emphasis on the court's distinction between the two. It notes the importance of freedom of speech but also suggests that it should not be used for malicious purposes.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets focus on the court's decision to remove defamatory content and emphasize the need for greater regulation of online speech to prevent character assassination campaigns. They also highlight the importance of protecting individual rights, particularly in the context of social media."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "विरोधाभासी सोशल मीडिया पोस्टों को हटाने के आदेश पर निष्कर्ष निकालने वाले लेफ्ट-लीनिंग आउटलेट्स व्यक्तिगत अधिकारों की रक्षा और व्यंगात्मक सामग्री और वैध आलोचना के बीच सीमा की पहचान करने पर जोर देते हैं।"}, "topic": "International", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/v2r5r0/article71168915.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/RAGHAV%20CHADHA%20BJP%20DELHI%202026_24_04_17.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Delhi/delhi-high-court-refuses-interim-protection-to-raghav-chadha-directs-takedown-of-five-posts/article71168890.ece", "headline": "Delhi High Court refuses interim protection to Raghav Chadha, directs takedown of five posts"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Delhi/delhi-high-court-on-raghav-chadha-seeking-personality-rights-protection/article71005467.ece", "headline": "Thin line between defamation and criticism: Delhi HC on Ragh